    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis fabulous three-bedroom end-of-terrace home is ideally located in the tranquil and highly sought-after Carraig Cluain development. Offering well-proportioned accommodation, a private rear garden and excellent convenience, this property is an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families or those looking for their forever home.\n\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room and guest WC. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from an ensuite, along with a family bathroom. Externally, the property features a private rear garden, perfect for enjoying outdoor dining and entertaining, together with convenient side access.\n\nLocated within walking distance of local schools, shops and Tullamore Hospital, the property enjoys a superb location close to all essential amenities. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate this wonderful home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.87m x 1.24m\nA welcoming, spacious entrance hallway providing access to the sitting room and kitchen.\n\nSitting Room - 4.40m x 3.49m\nA spacious sitting room with carpeted flooring, featuring a beautiful bay window and an attractive fireplace with a gas coal-effect fire.\n\nWC - 1.48m x 1.52m\nA freshly decorated guest WC, fitted with a WC and wash hand basin (WHB).\n\nDining room - 3.00m x 4.82m\nA spacious dining room featuring French doors opening onto the rear garden, with access to a useful storage room and an open-plan kitchen/dining area.\n\nKitchen - 2.46m x 1.63m\nA spacious kitchen fitted with an integrated hob and oven, a range of wall and floor-mounted cabinets, and tiled splashbacks, with access to the open-plan kitchen/dining area.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.93m x 2.93m\nA generously proportioned main bedroom overlooking the rear of the property, featuring carpeted flooring, triple fitted wardrobes, and the added luxury of an en-suite bathroom.\n\nEnsuite - 2.93m x 1.19m\nA convenient en-suite with tiled flooring, comprising a WC, wash hand basin (WHB), and a shower cubicle.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.76m x 2.74m\nA generously proportioned double bedroom with carpeted flooring, built-in wardrobes, and a front aspect.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.35m x 1.97m\nA spacious single bedroom with carpeted flooring, built-in wardrobes, and a front-facing aspect.\n\nBathroom - 1.958m x 1.71m\nA spacious family bathroom with tiled flooring, comprising a WC, wash hand basin (WHB), and a bath.\n\n"
      },
